, no repeated grant or rewriting original pools. ADR0082 initial-state closure: CORE-110 uses exact startsAt+60 schedule or proven NO_EFFECT; combined MON-023/SYM-034 HP uses exact1000 precedence and proven source/time state without replaying activation/expiry consequences. ADR0082 source closure: immutable old snapshots/FINAL/receipts/IDs/timestamps and exact proof prefixes are retained; new facts bind to actual owner/attempt/version/campaign/time and source instances. Unknown, missing, foreign, stale, changed or unproven historical data refuses with zero writes. No invented histories/RNG, unchecked numerical fields or second NPC shell; all new editable choices have actual controls, computed values remain read-only. COMMIT only: ADR0083: if a newly added Trogr dies within the same confirmation, that outcome is proven by the actual composition prefix; no new SYM-076 stat/reached/included/legacy fact, prior ledger unchanged or absent, independent absorption/duel/SYM-079 facts retained. COMMIT only: ADR0084 custom item closure: closed CATALOG_ITEM FK or campaign-bound CAMPAIGN_CUSTOM_PROFILE identity; explicit structured fields and NONE or one positive integer stat bonus; quantity=1 for each bonus instance; actual same-owner backpack or explicit outside state; immutable profile/version/provenance and separate source-derived item layer; no invented catalogue IDs, containers, defaults or replaced canonical mechanics.",
