и N+1 закрепляет одну из шести существующих local-character-portraits по raceCode и sex (UNITED использует explicit unified mapping). Полный snapshot хранит выбранный artAssetKey; открытие формы и reconnect не меняют сохранённый арт. Owner decision #186 C: the host-bound technical attempt carries campaignId, npcDraftId, attemptRevision and editMode=CREATE_V1|APPEND_N_PLUS_ONE. APPEND_N_PLUS_ONE additionally binds npcUuid and expectedCurrentVersion to the selected current snapshot. The client cannot select or change this mode/binding. All eight wizard stages preserve it; cancel before final commit creates no NPC version or history entry. Sole current authenticated campaign GM; persistent non-archived NPC; current campaign/npcUuid and expectedCurrentVersion match. UI-CMD-NPC-NEW-VERSION phase=OPEN is allowed only from NPC-003/NPC-007 and creates only a bound full-edit attempt from the current snapshot, without changing NPC/currentVersion/history; active combat retains its pinned prior snapshot. Sole current authenticated campaign GM; UI-CMD-NPC-NEW-VERSION phase=COMMIT only from NPC-017 with host-bound APPEND_N_PLUS_ONE attempt; expectedCurrentVersion and attemptRevision are current; all eight stages, sex/race/mass and resolved art validate. Atomically append the full N+1 snapshot/history to the same npcUuid; prior versions and combat pins remain unchanged. COMMIT only: При pre-Start calendar state подтверждены initial time и свежий host-bound PRE_START_INITIAL preview; после Start проверяется CURRENT_CAMPAIGN preview. Без календарного состояния time binding не требуется. Stale time/attempt/campaign revision causes zero write. COMMIT only: Initial trauma authoring is closed and source-valid: one explicit choice per host-bound trauma identity; final entered HP is preserved for TORSO; HEAD penalty=PENDING|CONSUMED and stun=ABSENT|ACTIVE are explicit. ACTIVE requires traumaValue>6, a canonical decimal-string remainingMinutes with exact rational 0<r<=5 and a current typed